{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_012_01_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:40a84e02825d034610deb52c0330a1cd67b00ec0f2a1829b2c7f2f6e15372c32",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bed52567d66f62e98ac90b5a91a20d246a351b4c764fb6b3c939287ffdd14855",
      "text": "让我当偶像……你是认真的吗？\n我可是今年都30岁的大男人了哦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a31589212e8c4d81ca92a75dd9d23d32d5a9bf6ef8b9b1f4c56f4918a5fd486",
      "text": "我32岁了。热情与年龄无关。\n请务必也借给我们一份力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9098d2e189c2522f8ec516891fdfd50f658707524860f34ea904d0f001dec503",
      "text": "就算你突然这么说……\n我也完全没有实感啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cbefa4edd35b1b52816f460233c79c6b0cd1dd69055c843a758944b2ad43de3",
      "text": "Mr. 山下，一起来做嘛！\n绝对超开心的，成功了还能大赚一笔哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26c84cfa45a09144be8950079ac21958b901f721e3bd34e22a8def93fa38dc6d",
      "text": "大……赚一笔？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdb3e1ac4cef41f88a18b39fc5ac54dfbb92db5a770b021df56e300911f74d47",
      "text": "Yes！我听Jupiter的北斗说的。\n当偶像可是many many money呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ceefb57483c022f85dcb806237e84ca9390d215134ab8cc3d83fd7882fe35783",
      "text": "many……many……money？那岂不是，\n连梦寐以求的马主都能当上了吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f6c857e108b2f8351e460d85d69adf16b8241b80016a5ffe996a46313d7618b",
      "text": "那种程度very easy啦☆\n除此以外，还能住高层豪宅之类的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f08eec91c397aea4b280600edc57a4919cf7a1aaf3be7180a9962fe228f67e4e",
      "text": "住高层豪宅……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbe20461e63038a1cbc7df7dd931bc8b61d4d05e08451cd1988207b488357db3",
      "text": "在海外建rich的度假别墅啦，\n用Money泡满浴缸洗澡啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b66c98e3a418dd473851a209da41d58d022e456a14459018a74329febe48dfe",
      "text": "豪华别墅……！？\n泡满money的浴缸……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_i:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0062383080d69b26b17640ca2422768070a9a037ca9cc2517c576bd42769ea5",
      "text": "怎么样，Mr. 山下？\n干劲……涌上来了吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
